<DocsExample TExample="ComboboxBasicExample" Title="Multi-select options" Description="Items is a list of NTComboboxOption objects. The bound value is a list of the selected values." />
<DocsExample TExample="ComboboxRichOptionsExample" Title="Icons and supporting text" Description="Options can show a LeadingIcon and SupportingText, and individual options can be disabled." />
